function ProviderPageRow({page}:{page:ProviderPage}){const provider=providerLabel(page.provider);const url=page.sourceUrl;let domain='';try{if(url)domain=new URL(url).hostname}catch{}return <div className="media-source-row media-provider-row">{url?<a className="media-source-link" href={url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><DomainIcon domain={domain} fallback={page.provider==='mangaupdates'?'MU':undefined}/><span><strong>{provider}</strong><small>Page utile de l’œuvre</small></span></a>:<div className="media-source-link"><Globe size={16} aria-hidden="true"/><span><strong>{provider}</strong><small>Page fournisseur indisponible</small></span></div>}{url&&<button type="button" className="icon-button" aria-label={`Copier l’URL ${provider}`} title={`Copier l’URL ${provider}`} onClick={()=>void copyText(url)}><Copy size={16}/></button>}</div>}
function sourceState(source:LibrarySource){return source.status==='STALE'?['Obsolète','stale'] as const:source.status==='MOVED'?['Lien déplacé','moved'] as const:source.status==='UNAVAILABLE'?['Site inaccessible','unavailable'] as const:source.status==='AVAILABLE'?['Disponible','available'] as const:null}
